Caliptra VCK190 infrastructure

The Caliptra FPGA patch modifies Apache-2.0-licensed sources from
https://github.com/chipsalliance/caliptra-sw at the revision in versions.env.
Upstream copyright notices and licenses remain applicable.

The device-tree settings were checked against AMD's 2024.2 board descriptions:
https://github.com/Xilinx/device-tree-xlnx/blob/xlnx_rel_v2024.2/device_tree/data/kernel_dtsi/2024.2/BOARD/versal-vmk180-reva.dtsi
VCK190 rev1.1 includes VMK180 rev1.1, which includes that board description.

